Name: jmap_max_delayed_send
Type: DURATION
Default-Value: 512d
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

The longest delay that EmailSubmission/set accepts in a HOLDFOR or
HOLDUNTIL parameter, advertised as the maxDelayedSend property of the
JMAP \"urn:ietf:params:jmap:submission\" capabilities object.  A
submission held for longer is rejected.  0 means delayed send is not
supported, and any HOLDFOR or HOLDUNTIL parameter is rejected.
